# Biome enforces LF (`lineEnding: "lf"`); without this, a fresh Windows clone
# with core.autocrlf=true checks out CRLF everywhere and `pnpm lint` reports
# hundreds of phantom format errors (audit finding).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.onnx binary
*.traineddata binary
*.wasm binary
